/// `fat_arrow_box`: the retired box `A => B` in a type position. The arrow
/// `A -> B` replaces it. The lowering refuses the box, and the refusal names
/// it, in a signature, a nested box, a group in parentheses and a record
/// field.
///
/// A parameter and a result keep the faults of their forms. A box in an
/// expression hole has no name. `rec t => S` and an arm `| m => e` keep their
/// readings.
@[refuses("RetiredSpelling.fat_arrow_box")]
def b : Integer => Integer;
